 * ========================================
 * INITIALIZATION CHECKLIST
 * ========================================
 * 
 * 1. Create Firestore database in Firebase Console
 * 2. Copy security rules from FIRESTORE_RULES.txt
 * 3. Click "Seed Tools" button in app (admin only)
 * 4. Verify tools collection has 30 documents
 * 5. Verify stats/global document exists
 * 6. Test public access (should see only enabled tools)
 * 7. Test admin access (should see all tools + stats)
